{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"Mictlan is a tall eldritch horror-esque kind of biblical angel-shaped being. Well, half. Wearing robes sort of open at the back to fit in the three pairs of wings. Many eyes stare out at him and there are shapes of scholarly materials in their pockets. They have that sort of awkward air that comes from definitely not being from the area and not being too good with people, or super familiar with English.","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:12:00.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863633702047055892","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"What do you know about plants?\" he asks","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:13:12.001000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:13:23.157000Z","id":"863634003596804096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"Well,\" they pause. \"Not much. But I learn fast.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:15:00.191000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863634457377767486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"As far as payment goes....\" he trails of unsure of how to proceed. \"Are you a spellcaster?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:24:49.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863636929218871366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"I am. A wizard. Yes,\" they say, pleasantly, as they lift a book out of their robes and show them the scrawl of magic spells. \"I am. Okay. At magic.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:27:45.091000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863637665601814558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"do you have any need of components? I suppose you could take what you need as you give the plants what they need.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:29:43.060000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:29:57.913000Z","id":"863638160398352396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"That. Would be nice,\" they nod. \"I. Thank you. I was. Also wondering. If lodgings. Or food. Could be provided. Or is anywhere nearby.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:31:04.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863638501336678420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"I know they're providing airslips for folks if you want a spot of your own. The parks around here are quite comfortable to sleep in around here, just don't stay for too long unless you wanna become a part of a whole new family.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:35:32.549000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863639626262773781","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"As far as food goes\" he turns around and rummages for a few moments and hands you a satchel \"heres some fruit and a few root veggies, this'll get you by til tomorrow. Eat whatever you need from the shop as long as you care for the plants here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:37:45.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863640184238506044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"854826651169587252","content":"\"Thank you. I am. Touched,\" they nod, blinking with a slightly lopsided smile. \"When do I. Come in. For work.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:38:48.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863640446193631252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
